   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS Climate Smart Community Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Foundation for Rural Development (FORD) Inc. is a registered local community-based organization 
dedicated to advancing climate-smart and sustainable development initiatives in Papua New Guinea. 
Recognizing the urgent challenges posed by climate change, FORD embarked on the Climate Smart 
Community Development Program with the conviction that empowering women, youths, and local 
communities would not only stimulate productivity and environmental protection but also ensure the 
preservation of natural resources for future generations.</narrative>
  </description>
